WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:11.240
mayakashi no izanai ni kotae tamae

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:11.240
Bewitched summoned being, entreat thou me thy reply.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.210
yobidashitaru sonata e to

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.210
Thou, who hast here summoned the likes of me,

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:32.840
michibikareshi mi wo

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:32.840
Bestow thou me guidance from thine own body.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:38.680
sashidasu wa senketsu no

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:38.680
Hark as this fresh blood from my fingertips flows,

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.850
yubisaki no akashi

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.850
As proof of our contract: Our destiny --

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:54.950
hikari no kami mo azamuku chikai

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:54.950
A vow to betray even the gods of Light.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:01:05.160
mayakashi no izanai ni kotae tamae

00:00:54.950 --> 00:01:05.160
Bewitched summoned being, entreat thou me thy reply.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:15.680
ochiru kogareru inochi wo toshite seiyaku no gi wo

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:15.680
As I plummet, I yearn for thee.
Swear to me thy very life.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:26.440
mune no kusabi ni tamuke no sanka shinen no chi e

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:26.440
Kiss the cleft of thy breast with my hesitant praise,
As we fall to earth to live the rest of our days.

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:53.490
Until recently, wolves flourished in abundance all across the country of Japan,

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:56.080
causing the population of their prey:

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:00.600
cows, horses, chickens, and other domesticated animals to rapidly decline.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.280
To defend against this threat, the wolves were hunted down,

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:06.140
and rabies was introduced to speed their extinction.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:13.440
As a result, the animals that were plentiful in the middle of the Edo era (1603-1868)

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:22.070
were all but gone by the 38th year of the Meiji period, 1905....

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:29.870
I'll... set you free.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:09.580
Pokaan ~

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:09.580
3

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:08.160
The Moon Spell is the Pedigree of Blood!

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:23.150
A ticket is 1500 yen.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:26.850
Oh, Liru-san! Go ahead.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.860
The usual, a pink rabbit.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:42.860
Thanks.

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:46.290
What happened to your arm?

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:48.810
Nothing.

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:10.170
Strength, huh...

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:14.460
A white angel.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.360
From the gentleman over there.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:26.660
Who?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.050
It's time for dinner!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.550
Time to eat!

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.810
How is it?

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.120
Average.

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:57.710
Well, it's not bad.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:05:01.360
The garlic is strong, so it feels like my blood is burning, but

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.890
maybe a little more seasoning would make it better...

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:05.740
It's fine.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.230
I'm stuffed...

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.170
He's gone, how could this-

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:31.100
Good evening.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:38.190
As I thought.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:40.440
Dammit...

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:45.230
That time, you tried to rescue those wolves.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:48.950
However, I can't figure out why you'd do that.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.280
That time?

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:54.330
You've got "the scent."

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.620
Ugh! The Chinese dumplings?!

00:05:56.990 --> 00:06:00.940
I-I'm sorry! I couldn't control myself, and...

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:03.840
I was thinking "I shouldn't, I shouldn't!" but...

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:07.790
Oh, so she wasn't one of us.

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:11.940
Well you know how girls, well you know...

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:15.780
they just lose it around food!

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:30.360
It's time for dinner!

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:32.870
Chow time!

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:40.280
How is it?

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:41.420
Average.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:48.440
What's wrong, Liru-san?

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.510
It'll all be gone soon. Are you not feeling well?

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.150
It's no good!

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:57.260
Liru-san?

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.520
It's no good!!

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:04.520
It's so painful... this thing called "love!"

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.120
I'm right here...

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.570
So we meet again.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.570
My heart's beating so fast!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:55.660
My name is Ryouma.

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:58.580
I'm Liru.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.710
You really do have "the scent."

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:06.590
What? I even skipped dinner!

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:09.590
It's a full moon tonight.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.380
Let's go.

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:36.660
A room.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.260
One where we can see the moon.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.430
Pay up front.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.220
You won't be able to see the moon in this cloudy night.

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:54.840
Is that so?

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:12.930
After this, I... it's going to be "that," wont it!

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:16.440
In other words, the stairwell to becoming an adult...

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:19.070
"If that's what you really want, then..." or...

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:23.260
Ahh! Meetings like this really do happen, don't they?!

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:26.250
The thing I've been dreaming about, right after this!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:30.250
Yeah right! I can't even see anything anymore!

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:40.510
It's finally time... Go me!

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:41.510
I love you.

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:42.910
I'll treasure you!

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.400
Now, let's make out!

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.770
And then... and then...!

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.360
The same race, after all.

00:09:56.560 --> 00:10:00.570
Please be gentle... pyon~

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:11.340
The wolves of this country were killed off many years ago.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:18.340
Our... is our fate to stay in this sad state of existence?

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:25.350
You had the scent of someone of our race.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:30.400
The scent? Our race? Could you be...?

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:39.650
That's right... Our meeting was fate!

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:45.970
We must preserve our race's existence.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.420
We can't be exterminated!

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:07.430
No!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:11.320
Don't just whip it out like that!

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:41.430
Looks like I just made us extinct.

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:59.440
Hey Cathy! Take a look at this!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:03.950
What happened, Bob? You've become so slim!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:07.910
I know! And it's all thanks to this electric trainer!

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:12.160
Wow! This is the latest electric trainer!

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:15.480
Amazing, this must be why you're so slim, right?

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:19.630
That's right, Cathy! The electric trainer works even better than the rumors say it does!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.420
So, when did you start using it?

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.760
Hm, maybe two weeks ago.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:27.630
What? You must be lying! In just two weeks,

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:30.770
you've gone from looking like this bloated onigiri Santa to a body like this?

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:32.400
That's right!

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:37.270
A wonderful piece of "shape up" technology, that's what this electric trainer is!

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:43.240
All you do is put it on, and then a slim body... will be yours!

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:49.290
Thanks to this, even those who don't exercise can rest easy.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:53.290
You simply have to get this machine! Hurry and call us at this toll-free number.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:57.860
Wow, I want to get an electric trainer and become slim too!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:04.430
Pokaan ~ 4

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:04.430
The Deceptive Spell is "TV Shopping"

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:10.470
Black Loincloth Mohawk

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:09.580
Delivery Service

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:08.080
Excuse me! I'm from the Black Loincloth Mohawk Delivery Service!

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:10.470
I have a package for you!

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:12.770
Thank you very much!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.310
Everyone, come and check this out!

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:26.420
What's all the noise about?

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:27.570
What is that?

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:33.980
Ai-chan, you're so out of it! This is the key to me getting a super-slim body,

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:36.580
a state-of-the-art shape-up machine!

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:39.540
It came, Uma?

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.370
Kek kek. Tada!

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:46.590
From this moment on, I don't have to worry about my waist any more!

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:51.560
Switch on! Say hello to the new, beautiful me!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.940
Wait, this is...

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:08.460
It's a catalogue!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:10.870
Oh wow, they have a lot of other stuff.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.160
It looks pretty cool!

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.080
Oh, stop, stop!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:22.440
So that's how they do it!

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:24.420
When people have tans even though it's not summer,

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:28.430
they're using something like this!

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:30.730
Alright, time to call them!

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:35.020
Oh, hello? Yes, I'm looking at the catalogue...

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:38.940
Umm... Yeah, one "High-Powered Sunbeam!"

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:41.900
Hey, don't hang up yet!  This is the one!

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:48.400
Yes, hello? One BU-500D, please.

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:51.570
What's that?

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:53.340
Oh, you know...

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:58.520
Well then, today's featured item is the new Iketani product,

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:01.080
the electric kitchen appliance: Cutter Sigma!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:05.760
So, how is this different from regular kitchen cutters?

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:12.700
Well, traditional kitchen cutters would only slice according to the shape of the blade you put in,

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.600
you don't have to worry about that mess!

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:16.600
What?!

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:17.450
What?!

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:22.210
Onions, carrots, cabbage, just go ahead and cut anything you want!

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:24.020
See, see? How is it?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:26.640
Wow! This is amazing!

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:32.650
And watch carefully! Just by turning this switch from "cut" to "shave..."

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:38.020
Shaved yams!
<i>Shaved yams!</i>

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:39.180
Yep!

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:43.700
Shaved yams are such a pain to cook, you know? They get in your nails, and....

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:47.030
Yes, but now you don't even need to grate them by hand.

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.510
And your hands just get so damn itchy!

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:53.090
No matter how small the yams are, you'll be able to shave them to the end!

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:58.770
The new product from Iketani, the electric Safety Cutter Sigma.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:58.770
Do you want one, Ai-chan?

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:01.980
Today, we'll be selling only 100 units.

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:05.100
Uma-san, this is amazing! It's something absolutely wonderful!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:08.120
Please rush to your phones and dial this number to order!

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:06.440
Really?

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:09.300
Yes! If I had one of these,

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:12.630
I'd never have to worry about cutting through the cutting board again!

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:15.130
Well then, why don't you call them?

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.740
Black Loincloth Mohawk

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.740
Delivery Service

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:24.250
Excuse me! I'm from the Black Loincloth Mohawk Delivery Service! I have a package for you!

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:28.570
Wow, so this is the High-Power Sunbeam!

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:30.260
It looks totally awethome!

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:34.020
So this is the kitchen cutter sigma!

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:36.670
Whoa, it's the same as the one we saw on TV!

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:39.260
So, what about yours, Pac-chan?

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.640
Awwright! It's here!

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:51.820
What's wrong, Pachi-chan? What is it? What is it?? Show us!

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:57.600
Oh, I suddenly got really sleepy...

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.330
Good night~

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:03.990
Well let's just leave her alone. Time to go enjoy myself!

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:06.620
She's right. Me too!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:09.340
Alright! Switch on!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:23.480
It's finally come. With this, I'll..!

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:35.490
I can see it, I can see it! My shining future!

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:43.870
This is amazing! I can't stop!

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:47.830
Yes! Today, our featured item is a digital camera!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:51.840
Digital camera? A digital camera! Yeah...

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:55.840
A 2 carat diamond looks elegant and...

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.840
That looks so nice...

00:17:56.310 --> 00:17:59.850
<i>This hanger is iron-okay!</i>

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:02.840
This is our new arrival, a digital high-definition television.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.850
It can receive over 200,000 channels or something.

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.960
It sure looks like a high-end product!

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.850
A high-end product!

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:10.190
Yes!

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.270
Yes, yes, yes!

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:13.860
That's right. Um...

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.190
Black Loincloth Mohawk

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.190
Delivery Service

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.190
Black Loincloth here!

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:22.200
Hello! I'm with the always refreshing pink hat no-pan express!

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:25.090
We have your plasma television!

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:27.210
It's so big! It won't fit!

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:30.210
Well, just put it down there!

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:12.990
Looking for a good subject for your photography?

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:14.110
Huh?

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:18.040
Oh, feel free to take as many as you want!

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:21.590
So, do you notice anything different?

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.050
Where?

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:27.800
Where? Just look a little closer and it should be obvious!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.100
Where?

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:34.060
Where? Jeez... My breasts.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.940
Huh? Haha...

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.530
Where're those?

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:42.000
What did you say??

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:45.740
Joking, joking. I'll take a picture of you.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:55.920
Oh... vampires don't show up on these.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:57.550
What? Seriously?

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:03.140
To think that you can't capture my beautiful figure...

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:05.540
What's goin' on?

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:09.150
Oh, Liru-san, have you been taking good pictures?

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:10.560
Oh, yeah.

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:20.530
I'm feeling so cozy-warm and sleepy, doesn't life just seem so peachy?

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.040
What?

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:27.930
Yes, hello?

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:30.290
Yes, that's correct.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.840
What? The bill?

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:39.260
These aren't free?!

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:44.850
Uma, what's the meaning of this?

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:48.430
Don't ask me...

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:51.750
If we don't ask you, then who are we supposed to ask?

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:54.160
You were the one that started all of this!

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:58.060
But, no one ever talked about money...

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:00.080
Then, it's one of those

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:03.360
deals where they try to send you things and then charge you for them later.

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:05.070
Yeah, it's something like that.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:17.600
Wow, I never knew how big this room was!

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:19.230
This isn't something to laugh at!

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:23.340
Um... everyone, isn't it fine?

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:27.720
We were able to experience being rich these last few days...

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:31.510
But I was finally seeing results!

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:33.980
And that was my first camera!

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:42.030
But, look! I made something similar to the one I had.

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.650
It might not look very nice, but....

00:21:46.090 --> 00:21:47.530
Well then, let's turn it on!

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:30.590
same kitta okazu ja wakimasen yo shokuyoku

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:30.590
You can't satisfy my hunger with cold leftovers!

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:46.010
hokaku shichaimashou tobikkiri no otoko no ko

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:46.010
So how about we land ourselves some choice guys?

00:22:46.110 --> 00:22:58.800
ikiru tame dato ka jama kusai desu daigi meibun

00:22:46.110 --> 00:22:58.800
My reason for living can be a pain in the tail sometimes.

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:05.000
honnou desu oniku desu u

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:05.000
It's my instincts! It's meat!

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:06.700
doreshido midofado~

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:10.660
tsukiyo, mangetsu! chi ga futtou

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:10.660
A night bathed in the light of the full moon makes my blood run wild!

00:23:10.960 --> 00:23:13.110
mamama makimoki mukumuku

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:14.750
pururun kanshoku

00:23:14.750 --> 00:23:16.560
raberabe howahowa

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:23.870
gion wa aru imi koi no jumon

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:23.870
You could say this is a spell of love!

00:23:23.870 --> 00:23:26.030
papapa paparun munemune

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:27.720
uttori yussabi

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:29.720
petapeta nokinoki

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:34.100
yasseiteki na atashi de GO!

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:34.100
Go out with someone with a wild side -- me!

